{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46774","headline":"重宿旧房与愚上人静话 · 齐己","name":"重宿旧房与愚上人静话","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾此栖心过十冬，今来潇洒属生公。\n檀栾旧植青添翠，菡萏新栽白换红。\n北面城临灯影合，西隣壁近讲声通。\n不知门下趋筵士，何似当时石解空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}